## Article 273. Cases on challenging decisions of election commissions

```catala
declaration scope Article273ElectionCommissionChallenge:
  input challenge content ElectionCommissionChallenge
  output challengeHasStanding content YesNo
  output challengeTimely content YesNo

scope Article273ElectionCommissionChallenge:
# Standing: voter, candidate, authorized representative, or prosecutor
  label standing_voter definition challengeHasStanding under condition
    challenge.challengeFiledByAuthorizedPerson = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label standing_default definition challengeHasStanding equals No

# Timely when filed within election period
  label timely_election definition challengeTimely under condition
    challenge.filingWithinElectionPeriod = Yes
    and challenge.challengeFiledTimely = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely definition challengeTimely under condition
    challenge.challengeFiledTimely = No
    consequence equals No

  label timely_default definition challengeTimely equals No
```

## Article 274. Jurisdiction over election commission challenges

```catala
declaration scope Article274ElectionJurisdiction:
  input challenge content ElectionCommissionChallenge
  output localCourtHasJurisdiction content YesNo
  output appellateCourtHasJurisdiction content YesNo
  output supremeCourtHasJurisdiction content YesNo

scope Article274ElectionJurisdiction:
# Local court for precinct commission decisions
  label local_jurisdiction definition localCourtHasJurisdiction under condition
    challenge.commissionLevel = ElectionCommissionLevel.PrecinctElectionCommission
    consequence equals Yes

# Appellate court for district commission decisions
  label appellate_jurisdiction definition appellateCourtHasJurisdiction under condition
    challenge.commissionLevel = ElectionCommissionLevel.DistrictElectionCommission
    and challenge.appellateCourtJurisdiction = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Supreme Court for CEC decisions
  label supreme_jurisdiction definition supremeCourtHasJurisdiction under condition
    challenge.commissionLevel = ElectionCommissionLevel.CentralElectionCommission
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_local definition localCourtHasJurisdiction equals No

  label no_appellate definition appellateCourtHasJurisdiction equals No

  label no_supreme definition supremeCourtHasJurisdiction equals No
```

## Article 275. Challenging CEC decisions on candidate registration

```catala
declaration scope Article275CandidateRegistration:
  input challenge content ElectionCommissionChallenge
  input relief content ElectionCaseRelief
  output registrationChallengeAllowed content YesNo

scope Article275CandidateRegistration:
# CEC registration decisions challenged in Supreme Court
  label registration_challenge definition registrationChallengeAllowed under condition
    challenge.commissionLevel = ElectionCommissionLevel.CentralElectionCommission
    and relief.candidateRegistrationChallenged = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label registration_default definition registrationChallengeAllowed equals No
```

## Article 276. Court consideration of election cases

```catala
declaration scope Article276ElectionCaseConsideration:
  input challenge content ElectionCommissionChallenge
  output caseConsideredImmediately content YesNo
  output fiveDayDeadlineApplies content YesNo

scope Article276ElectionCaseConsideration:
# Election cases considered immediately or within 5 days
  label considered_immediately definition caseConsideredImmediately under condition
    challenge.challengeFiledBeforeVoting = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label considered_five_days definition caseConsideredImmediately under condition
    challenge.challengeFiledBeforeVoting = No
    consequence equals No

# Five-day deadline applies to all election cases
  label five_day definition fiveDayDeadlineApplies equals Yes
```

## Article 277. Court decision in election cases

```catala
declaration scope Article277ElectionDecision:
  input relief content ElectionCaseRelief
  output mayObligateCommission content YesNo
  output mayEstablishElectionResult content YesNo

scope Article277ElectionDecision:
# Court may obligate commission to perform action
  label obligate definition mayObligateCommission under condition
    relief.commissionDecisionUnlawful = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Only court may establish election result when challenged
  label establish_result definition mayEstablishElectionResult under condition
    relief.electionResultChallenged = Yes
    and relief.onlyCourtMayEstablishElectionResult = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_obligate definition mayObligateCommission equals No

  label no_establish definition mayEstablishElectionResult equals No
```

## Article 278. Filing deadlines for election cases

```catala
declaration scope Article278ElectionFilingDeadlines:
  input filing content ElectionCaseFiling
  output filingWithinDeadline content YesNo

scope Article278ElectionFilingDeadlines:
# Filing within 10 days of commission decision
  label ten_day definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    filing.filedWithinTenDaysOfDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Filing within 5 days of election for election result challenges
  label five_day definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    filing.filedWithinFiveDaysOfElection = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label filing_default definition filingWithinDeadline equals No
```

## Article 279. Appeal deadlines in election cases

```catala
declaration scope Article279ElectionAppealDeadlines:
  input deadline content ElectionAppealDeadline
  output appealWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output cassationWithinDeadline content YesNo

scope Article279ElectionAppealDeadlines:
# Appeal: 5 days from decision
  label appeal_five_days definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceDecision <= 5
    consequence equals Yes

# Cassation: 5 days from appellate decision
  label cassation_five_days definition cassationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.isSupremeCourtDecision = No
    and deadline.daysSinceDecision <= 5
    consequence equals Yes

  label appeal_expired definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceDecision > 5
    consequence equals No

  label cassation_expired definition cassationWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.daysSinceDecision > 5
    consequence equals No
```
